imx585-dkms (0.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of IMX585 DKMS driver package
  * Support for Sony IMX585 CMOS image sensor
  * DKMS integration for automatic kernel module rebuilding
  * Device tree overlay compilation and installation
  * Support for various sensor configurations:
    - 2-lane and 4-lane MIPI CSI-2 modes
    - Monochrome variants
    - Configurable link frequencies
    - Sync modes (internal-leader, internal-follower, external)
    - RAW10 and RAW12 pixel formats

 -- Dale Ghent <daleg@elemental.org>  Mon, 02 Jun 2026 21:23:00 +0000
